[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:38. Everything Except the Weather]
[00:00.780]Passage 38 | 文章三十八
[00:02.720]Everything except the weather. | 除了天气之外的一切。
[00:06.465]My old friend Harrison | 我的老朋友哈里森
[00:09.950]had lived in the Mediterranean for many years | 已经在地中海地区生活多年，
[00:13.490]before he returned to England. | 然后他才回到英国。
[00:16.060]He had often dreamed of retiring in England | 他经常梦想着在英国退休，
[00:19.960]and had planned to settle down in the country. | 并计划在乡村定居。
[00:23.640]He had no sooner returned than he bought a fine house | 他一回来就买了一栋漂亮的房子，
[00:27.875]and went to live there. | 并搬去那里住。
[00:30.065]Almost immediately, | 几乎立刻，
[00:32.890]he began to complain about the weather. | 他就开始抱怨天气了。
[00:36.135]For even though it was still summer, | 因为即使当时仍然是夏天，
[00:38.920]it rained continually | 天气也持续下雨，
[00:41.270]and it was often bitterly cold. | 而且经常是严寒。
[00:44.170]After so many years of sunshine, | 在阳光明媚的许多年之后，
[00:47.590]Harrison got a shock. | 哈里森大吃一惊。
[00:50.190]He acted as if he had never lived in England before. | 他的表现就好像他以前从未在英国生活过一样。
[00:54.540]In the end, | 最终，
[00:56.330]it was more than he could bear. | 这超出了他所能承受的范围。
[00:58.750]He had hardly had time to settle down | 他还没来得及安顿下来，
[01:02.295]when he sold the house and left the country. | 他就卖掉了房子离开了这个国家。
[01:06.105]The dream he had had for so many years | 他多年的梦想
[01:09.590]ended there. | 就此终结。
[01:11.025]Harrison had thought of everything | 哈里森考虑了所有事情，
[01:14.150]except the weather. | 除了天气。